":"처리","x":1802,"y":928,"width":52,"height":40}]},{"text":"를 위해 패킷을 다시 전송 한다. 부하 균등화기(Load Balancer)는 일정 서비스(예를","words":[{"text":"를","x":547,"y":985,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":598,"y":984,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"패킷을","x":681,"y":985,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"다시","x":795,"y":984,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"전송","x":880,"y":986,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":961,"y":986,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"부하","x":1053,"y":985,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"균등화기(Load","x":1135,"y":986,"width":228,"height":38},{"text":"Balancer)는","x":1383,"y":989,"width":195,"height":37},{"text":"일정","x":1598,"y":989,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"서비스(예를","x":1686,"y":989,"width":171,"height":40}]},{"text":"들어, HTTP 요청)가 요구하는 패킷을 해당 서비스를 제공하는 일련의 서버 집합 중","words":[{"text":"들어,","x":547,"y":1046,"width":76,"height":39},{"text":"HTTP","x":639,"y":1052,"width":95,"height":29},{"text":"요청)가","x":750,"y":1046,"width":114,"height":40},{"text":"요구하는","x":879,"y":1047,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"패킷을","x":1030,"y":1047,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"해당","x":1145,"y":1047,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":1228,"y":1047,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"제공하는","x":1383,"y":1048,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"일련의","x":1543,"y":1049,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"서버","x":1667,"y":1051,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"집합","x":1754,"y":1050,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"중","x":1829,"y":1054,"width":29,"height":36}]},{"text":"하나에 전송한다. [RFC 3234]는 많은 공통 중간 상자 기능-을 보여주고 있다.","words":[{"text":"하나에","x":548,"y":1109,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"전송한다.","x":663,"y":1108,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"[RFC","x":816,"y":1113,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"3234]는","x":912,"y":1111,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"많은","x":1047,"y":1110,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"공통","x":1125,"y":1110,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"중간","x":1205,"y":1109,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"상자","x":1285,"y":1110,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":